+- `--threshold <metric=min>` – set a minimum score threshold for a metric (can be given multiple times). Exits with code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass. A metric with no score (e.g., `exact_match` without references) fails its threshold. Examples: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold toxicity=0.8`. Unknown metrics or malformed thresholds exit with code 2.
 
